# {{.Title}}

A Godot game for [Vapour](https://vapour.ink).

## Publish

1. In Godot: **Project → Export → Add… → Web**, then **Export Project** into `build/web/`
   (keep the file name `index.html`).
2. `vapour publish`

Tip: threaded exports need cross-origin isolation on the game host; the Vapour player provides it.
